2.  **Topical Treatment:** Clean the skin lesions gently with a mild antiseptic solution (e.g., chlorhexidine 2-4% or povidone-iodine 1-2%). Apply a topical antibiotic/anti-inflammatory ointment (e.g., containing mupirocin or bacitracin) to prevent secondary bacterial infection.
3.  **Investigate Drooling:** Drooling combined with skin lesions and illness suggests possible oral pain, nausea, or toxin exposure. Check the mouth for ulcers, foreign bodies, or signs of oral thrush. Ensure fresh water is available but monitor for aspiration risk if the animal is lethargic.
4.  **Supportive Care:** Provide soft, palatable food to encourage intake. Ensure the animal is warm and comfortable.
5.  **Veterinary Follow-up:** Despite the low risk label, the combination of "very ill," skin lesions, and drooling warrants a prompt veterinary examination to rule out systemic infections, toxin exposure, or underlying metabolic issues that may not be immediately apparent. Do not delay professional assessment if the animal&#8217;s condition deteriorates.</t></is></c><c r="P2" t="inlineStr"><is><t>2026-09-27 18:14:53</t></is></c><c r="Q2" t="inlineStr"><is><t>123456789101</t></is></c><c r="R2" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Location access denied</t></is></c><c r="S2" t="inlineStr"><is><t>denied</t></is></c></row><row r="3"><c r="A3" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Ramesh Patil</t></is></c><c r="B3" t="inlineStr"><is><t>9876543210</t></is></c><c r="D3" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Kolhapur</t></is></c><c r="E3" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Cow</t></is></c><c r="F3" t="inlineStr"><is><t>3</t></is></c><c r="G3" t="inlineStr"><is><t>0</t></is></c><c r="H3" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Fever</t></is></c><c r="I3" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Skin Nodules</t></is></c><c r="J3" t="inlineStr"><is><t>2 days</t></is></c><c r="K3" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Skin looks bumpy</t></is></c><c r="M3" t="n"><v>85</v></c><c r="N3" t="inlineStr"><is><t>HIGH</t></is></c><c r="O3" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Immediate isolation required.</t></is></c><c r="P3" t="inlineStr"><is><t>2026-09-25 18:34:11</t></is></c><c r="Q3" t="inlineStr"><is><t>999999999900</t></is></c><c r="R3" t="inlineStr"><is><t>16.7050</t></is></c><c r="S3" t="inlineStr"><is><t>74.2433</t></is></c></row><row r="4"><c r="A4" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Suresh Mane</t></is></c><c r="B4" t="inlineStr"><is><t>9876543211</t></is></c><c r="D4" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Kolhapur</t></is></c><c r="E4" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Cow</t></is></c><c r="F4" t="inlineStr"><is><t>5</t></is></c><c r="G4" t="inlineStr"><is><t>1</t></is></c><c r="H4" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Skin Lesions</t></is></c><c r="I4" t="inlineStr"><is><t>High Fever, Weakness</t></is></c><c r="J4" t="inlineStr"><is><t>4 days</t></is></c><c r="K4